          "filename": "Turf Cutting - Industrial - geograph.org.uk - 1297685.jpg",
          "caption": "Turf Cutting - Industrial This process is as far removed from domestic turf cutting as it is possible to get.  The whole surface of the bog is removed.  The stripped material is transported to the electricity generating station at Bellacorick.  The station was closed in 2005 and the cooling towers demolished in 2007.",
